      ],
      "en": "Therefore you will have no one who divides the land by lot in the LORD’s assembly.",
      "ko": "그러므로 여호와의 회중에서 제비를 뽑고 줄을 띨 자가 너희 중에 하나도 없으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "1a2291447918800a06f52631cbb23fb889ee8ada3fef62a900b93909367ef093",
      "translation_text_hash": "e5bce032f56b5034a2530cc3b1554b1c06a4ec777e64ffc0c18a60a04f213266",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
